  "figures": {
    "13_no_command_share_by_category.png": "119 validation sessions send no data (spkts, sbytes, sload and ackdat all 0). Every saved model has a validation cluster of exactly that size; the group mixes all 8 generator categories, so any cluster that captures it cannot separate those categories.",
